# Xotik copy

## Voice

- English-clean default; Hinglish toggle for Gen Z lines
- Active voice, specific claims only (verified product language)
- No competitor names in user-facing copy

## stop-slop

- No filler openers ("Here's what…", "In today's world…")
- No invented metrics or fake press
- No em dashes in marketing copy
- Headlines: roman weight/color emphasis, not italic display type

## Source of truth

All EN/Hinglish strings live in `src/lib/copy.ts`. Do not scatter duplicate strings.
